--- task
id: a08
dataset: attribution
kind: a top-1 read feeding a traversal
answer: fewest
composition: a cut, then a traversal from what survives: edition 2 has no read whose `limit` applies before a later traversal, so the identity comes back first

--- intent
Which sources did the identity behind the single heaviest touchpoint touch? Return the distinct source slugs.

--- edition2
query heaviest_identity() {
  match { $t: Touchpoint  $t touchpointByIdentity $x }
  return { $x.slug }
  order { $t.weight desc }
  limit 1
}

--- edition2 bind top=1:x.slug
query sources_of($top: [String]) {
  match { $x: ExternalID  $x.slug in $top  $t touchpointByIdentity $x  $t touchpointOnSource $s }
  return distinct { $s.slug }
}

--- edition3
query heaviest_identity_sources() {
  match {
    from { match { $t: Touchpoint  $t touchpointByIdentity $x } return { $x } order { $t.weight desc } limit 1 }
    $u touchpointByIdentity $x
    $u touchpointOnSource $s
  }
  return distinct { $s.slug }
}

--- expect unordered
columns: ["s.slug"]
["s1"]
["excluded"]
